# T04 analysis of evidence/headline

## Validity gates
| gate | what | result | detail |
|---|---|---|---|
| V1 | independent check verify_t04.py | PASS | 577,117 comparisons, 0 failures; corrupted copy detected: True; I5 SuperTrend branch: desk reading |
| V2 | point in time | PASS | 411 decisions, 0 labels after the decision; 410 trades, 0 not after their decision; 75,292 indicator stock-dates, 0 bars after the query date; 351 weekly-candle recomputations on bars up to the query date |
| V3 | null holds its table | PASS | 10,000 draws x 2 windows; 3,336,681 SELL decisions with k mismatches 0; 398,000 BUY events with mismatches 0 |
| V4 | always-in reproduces the published NAV | PASS | 2019-01-02 -> 2026-10-22: CAGR gap +0.045 pp/yr (limit 0.25); worst calendar year 2022 +0.426 pp (limit 0.5) |
| V5 | indicator reproducibility | PASS | 50 stock-date pairs vs a hand computation, 0 failed |

Cross-checks against T03 (not gates): regime series equals T03's on 400 shared decision dates with 0 mismatches; the full-switch comparator reproduces T03's SCMO_0003 strategy NAV (cost 0 / 20.8 / 50) to a maximum relative difference of 3.1e-15 up to 2026-08-07 (after that T03 accrued cash by a 90-session rate; this run reads the extended LBES).

## 4.0 The decision series
- Window 2019-01-02 -> 2026-11-04: 1,935 sessions, 411 weekly decisions (T0 plus the last session of each later ISO week), the last one not traded.
- BUY 201 weeks, SELL 210 weeks; 10 SELL spells (the independent unit) of [5, 9, 11, 15, 16, 18, 29, 30, 37, 40] decisions, 9 BUY spells.
- Live window starts 2021-11-01: 263 decisions.

