READINGS (engine): E1: calendar = D17's dates 2019-01-02 -> 2026-10-22, then the D18 sessions after it up to 2026-11-04; E2: stock bars used for indicators: every D18 bar up to 2019-01-02, after that only bars on calendar sessions (F-AA-D15); E3: indicator tables are computed at the decision dates and at the live window's first date only; for a stock whose weekly candle has a bar after the query date the supertrend is recomputed on bars up to the query date (the live first date, a Monday); E4: I5 sign BUY iff ST sits on the final lower band (|ST-FLB|<1e-9); NaN or neither band = not computable = excluded; E5: n and k of a decision are measured on the basket in force at its trade session (at the decision session for the last decision); E6: the null draws one uniform per stock per decision: the k_j(b) smallest of u[j] within basket b are kept (uniform k-subset); E7: R5 = per draw_id the best of the five indicators' draws of that id (the plan's 'shared permutation seed' read as 'same draw id'); E8: initial position: basket at T0 as drifted since its availableDate scaled to 1 at T0's close; stocks outside the T0 kept set are sold at T0's close into the sleeve at no cost; BUY = whole basket (sleeve exactly 0); E9: basket weights normalised to sum 1 over the whole basket; kept stocks keep their normalised weights; E10: constant mix: stock share f = mean over decisions of sum of kept weights (BUY = 1), rebalanced at the next session of every decision (T0's included) and at every basket change; initial stock holding = drifted basket scaled by f; E11: full AA switch comparator = this engine with k = 0 on every SELL decision (T03's rule on this window)

GOLDBEES trade sessions after the MCX file's end (2026-09-28), fill = raw OHLC4: 2026-10-05 -0.22% from close; 2026-10-12 +0.54% from close; 2026-10-19 +0.15% from close; 2026-10-26 -0.20% from close; 2026-11-02 +0.27% from close.

